      A cheap screw-top canister stove, a 100 g (or 110 g) gas canister, a small
      pot with a wide base and a lighter. If budget beats weight, swap the canister
      for the A$5 Gasmate 230 g from Bunnings. That covers dinner, a hot drink and breakfast for
      one person with fuel to spare. Our <a href="/gear/aluminium-cookware-set/"
